ios-host-gles-option.patch：给 meson 加 host_gles 构建开关（-Dhost_gles=disabled / --disable-host-gles）。

原因：iOS SDK 带 OpenGLES.framework，上游 meson 只要找到它就自动编 EAGL 版 GL 桥（gles-host.c + gles-host-eagl.c），
没有办法关。M1 第一次开机要先不用宿主 GL（调研报告 4.5）：GL 桥换成 gles-host-stub.c，客体探测 GLES HLE 失败后
退回自己的软件合成，把「能不能开机」和「GL 对不对」分开验证，也让快照不被 GL 状态挡住。
默认值 auto，行为和上游一样；只有显式 disabled 才走 stub。
基于 samhenrigold/qemu-ios b225694505。

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index be28191129..4102f5d67a 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -1250,10 +1250,12 @@ endif
 # which is what keeps a tile-based GPU from being drained by a glReadPixels
 # every frame. gles-host.c falls back to that readback if any of it is missing
 # at RUNTIME, but the link needs all three.
+# -Dhost_gles=disabled builds the stub on iOS too, so a first boot can run on the
+# guest's software compositor alone (and stay snapshot-safe) before the EAGL path is tried.
 host_gles = dependency('appleframeworks',
                        modules: ['OpenGLES', 'Foundation', 'IOSurface',
                                  'CoreFoundation'],
-                       required: false)
+                       required: get_option('host_gles'))
 
 vmnet = dependency('appleframeworks', modules: 'vmnet', required: get_option('vmnet'))
 if vmnet.found() and not cc.has_header_symbol('vmnet/vmnet.h',
